  "project_description": "Menu Link Revisions brings Drupal's powerful revision management system to menu items, providing functionality similar to node revisions. This module enables content teams to:\n\n \n Track every change to menu links with full revision history \n Revert to previous versions of menu items \n Maintain draft and published states using the existing \"enabled\" field \n Manage access with granular permissions \n \n By adding robust version control to menus, this module helps maintain accurate navigation structures and simplifies recovery from accidental changes or unwanted modifications.",
